    "body": "Since this is clipboard related, @garykac do you think this makes sense in Chromium? This amounts to adding `oncopy` and friends to `window`, since the events bubble to `window` but were never added there because (seemingly) IE didn't have the handler attributes there.\r\n\r\n@jgraham do you know who could look at this for Gecko?\r\n\r\n@cdumez do you know who could look at this for WebKit?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
